  "remarks": "Moonstone Maritime Corporation is a shipping company based in Liberia and the commercial operator of the vessels Sikar, Samira, Eminent and Canara. Those vessels lack adequate liability insurance and engage in ship-to-ship transfers as well as manipulation of Automatic Identification Systems while transporting crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia. Therefore, Moonstone Maritime Corporation operates vessels that transport crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia and practice irregular and high-risk shipping practices as set out in the International Maritime Organization General Assembly resolution A.1192(33).",
